  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fry the chopped onion in a large pan, then add the sliced garlic and chopped capsicum. When soft, add the diced tomatoes, sugar, chilli and tomato paste. Season to taste, add the parsley and set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer potato slices, then eggplant slices, then more potato in a baking dish. Drizzle olive oil and lemon juice between the layers, season with salt, pepper, cumin and paprika and cover with foil. Bake at 200°C for 30 to 40 minutes (check the potatoes are soft), removing the foil for the last 10 minutes. Pour the tomato sauce over the top."
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the tahini and breadcrumbs in a bowl and add water to make a thick sauce. Pour over the moussaka and return to the oven for 5 to 10 minutes until bubbling."
    }
  ]
